Third-party libraries in the built artifacts
--------------------------------------------

The repository contains no third-party libraries. The build downloads them, and the jars and Docker images it
produces bundle them under their own licenses. The libraries this project depends on directly are listed here; each
brings its own dependencies, whose licenses apply as well:

  Saxon-HE (Saxonica)             Mozilla Public License 2.0, source code: https://github.com/Saxonica/Saxon-HE
  SchXslt2 (David Maus)           MIT License
  Jackson (FasterXML)             Apache License 2.0
  Spring Boot, Spring Framework   Apache License 2.0 (pseudo-platform only)
  Thymeleaf                       Apache License 2.0 (pseudo-platform only)

The Docker stack in deploy/ additionally pulls the official images of Domibus (EUPL 1.2) and MySQL (GPL 2.0). They
run as separate services and are not part of this repository.
